{
  "schema": "yoyo.swplan/1",
  "meta": {
    "name": "探针 S族：缝合曲面（两个**共边**的平面 → 缝成一个曲面体）体数 2→1",
    "units": "mm",
    "note": [
      "★★★ 缝合的关键是**共边（coincident edges），不是共面**（2026-10-09 真机验出）：",
      "  一开始拿「两根共享一个面的方管」当用例 —— 特征建出来了、**体数死活不合并**。",
      "  换成「两个**共边**的平面」立刻 2→1。**共面 ≠ 能缝**，这是缝合最容易踩的判据坑。",
      "★ 几何：",
      "  EA = Front 面上过 (-30,0)→(30,0) 的横线拉伸 40 ⇒ 60×40 平面（2400mm²）",
      "  EB = Front 面上过 (30,0)→(30,30) 的竖线拉伸 40 ⇒ 30×40 平面（1200mm²）",
      "  两者共用一条边（X=30, Y=0, Z∈[0,40]）⇒ 合计 3600mm²",
      "  ★ 本模板里 **Front 面 = XY 平面（法线 Z）**：草图 x→模型 X、草图 y→模型 Y。",
      "    所以拉伸方向是 Z、这里的『横线/竖线』拉出来的是**竖平面**。",
      "★ 缝合后：曲面体 2→1，面积仍是 3600（只并体、不并面 —— 两块面不共面，交线是真实棱边）。",
      "★ 参数用**官方 Create Surface Knit Feature 范例**那一套：",
      "  gap_filters=True, form_solid=False, merge_entities=False,",
      "  tolerance=0.0001mm, max_gap=0.0001mm。",
      "  （官方界限：容差 0.0001~0.1mm）",
      "★ form_solid=False 是**故意**的：这两个平面不封闭，强行缝成实体只会失败。",
      "  『缝成实体』要等有闭合体积（CRH380CL 车体收口）再验。"
    ]
  },
  "params": {},
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "n",
      "op": "new_part"
    },
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "op": "select_plane",
      "plane": "Front"
    },
    {
      "id": "sa1",
      "op": "sketch_begin"
    },
    {
      "id": "la",
      "op": "line",
      "x1": -30,
      "y1": 0,
      "x2": 30,
      "y2": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "sa2",
      "op": "sketch_end",
      "name": "ESkA"
    },
    {
      "id": "ea",
      "op": "surface_extrude",
      "depth": 40,
      "name": "EA"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "op": "select_plane",
      "plane": "Front"
    },
    {
      "id": "sb1",
      "op": "sketch_begin"
    },
    {
      "id": "lb",
      "op": "line",
      "x1": 30,
      "y1": 0,
      "x2": 30,
      "y2": 30
    },
    {
      "id": "sb2",
      "op": "sketch_end",
      "name": "ESkB"
    },
    {
      "id": "eb",
      "op": "surface_extrude",
      "depth": 40,
      "name": "EB"
    },
    {
      "id": "cb0",
      "op": "check_body",
      "expect_sheet": 2,
      "expect_solid": 0,
      "expect_area_mm2": 3600,
      "area_tol": 0.001
    },
    {
      "id": "kt",
      "op": "surface_knit",
      "targets": ["EA", "EB"],
      "tolerance": 0.0001,
      "max_gap": 0.0001,
      "gap_filters": true,
      "form_solid": false,
      "merge_entities": false,
      "name": "Knit1"
    },
    {
      "id": "cb1",
      "op": "check_body",
      "expect_sheet": 1,
      "expect_solid": 0,
      "expect_area_mm2": 3600,
      "area_tol": 0.001
    }
  ]
}
